{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amakta is a simultaneous turn based strategy board game for two players. It transforms a minimalistic ruleset into astonishing strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by placing your first stone on your base tile, excert influence on surrounding tiles, expand your territory, capture your opponent's stones, disrupt their defences and finally conquer their base tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players perform their turns at the same time. Simultaneity elevates the weight each decision carries, leads to less waiting for your opponent and ensures true equality between the player colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play online vs your Steam friends, locally on the same machine in Hotseat mode or challenge one of the AIs. Furthermore, the game supports the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >responsive and straightforward experience by previewing potential turns on hover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >getting started quickly with the basic tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >built-in time control options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >browsable game history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >runs on every potato</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What not to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no action, just the board game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no fancy visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no music, only basic sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no public matchmaking, so no matches against strangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736970?t=1754067952","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736970?t=1754067952","capsule_image":"https://shar