 basic tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >built-in time control options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >browsable game history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >runs on every potato</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What not to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no action, just the board game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no fancy visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no music, only basic sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no public matchmaking, so no matches against strangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no achievements</p></li></ul>","developers":["Osyfe Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736970/424978dee15433f6605b1f2f2cd096c9c837f17f/header.jpg?t=1754067952","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit, 1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736970/551985549/6f061ebfd00ce297a5b145f10c3667d33499e2b2/1752518433/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752874423","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736970/551985549/6f061ebfd00ce297a5b145f10c3667d33499e2b2/1752518433/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752874423","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akama